@startuml classes
title Классы модели СМО, вариант 22
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum EventKind {
  REQUEST_GENERATED
  SERVICE_FINISHED
  BUFFER_DISPATCH
}

class EventCalendar {
  +schedule(time, kind, ...)
  +next() : Event
  +now() : float
}

class Event {
  +time : float
  +kind : EventKind
  +source
  +request
  +device
}

class Request {
  +id() : str
  +sourceId() : int
  +tGen : float
}

class Buffer {
  +capacity : int
  +putInArrivalOrder(req) : PutResult
  +take(req)
  +evictLastArrived() : Request
  +selectHighestPriority(allowedSources) : Request
}

class PlacementDispatcher {
  +onRequestGenerated(req) : PutResult
}

class SelectionDispatcher {
  +tryAssignOne() : bool
  +tryAssignAll()
  +canAssign() : bool
  +lastSelected() : Request
  +ringPointer() : int
}

class Device {
  +id() : int
  +groupSource() : int
  +isFree() : bool
  +assign(req, now) : float
  +complete(now) : Request
}

class InfiniteSource {
  +onDue(now) : (Request, dt)
}

class Simulation {
  +requestDispatch()
  +onBufferDispatch()
  +setupArrivals()
}

class StepSnapshot {
  +time
  +event
  +request
  +buffer
  +devices
  +pointer
  +selected
}

class SimConfig {
  +nSources = 4
  +nDevices = 0
  +bufferDwell
}

class ClimateState {
  +applyServed(sourceId)
  +applyWeather(...)
}

EventCalendar "1" o-- "*" Event
Event --> EventKind
Simulation *-- EventCalendar
Simulation *-- Buffer
Simulation *-- PlacementDispatcher
Simulation *-- SelectionDispatcher
Simulation *-- "*" Device
Simulation *-- "*" InfiniteSource
Simulation *-- ClimateState
Simulation *-- SimConfig
Simulation --> StepSnapshot
PlacementDispatcher --> Buffer : только буфер
SelectionDispatcher --> Buffer
SelectionDispatcher --> "*" Device : группы по sourceId
InfiniteSource --> Request : создаёт
Device --> Request : обслуживает

note right of PlacementDispatcher
  ДП классический:
  приборов не знает.
end note

note right of SelectionDispatcher
  Д2Б4: одна заявка, min sourceId,
  затем самая старая.
  Д2П2: кольцо внутри группы показателя.
end note

note bottom of Simulation
  Выдача из БП - событие BUFFER_DISPATCH
  с задержкой bufferDwell.
end note
@enduml
